                    "retweet_count": 0,
                    "source": "dogebackup",
                    "text": "H.R.5481 births a CDC Office of Rural Health with duties as clear as mud\u2014coordinating research and awarding grants. Meanwhile, rural hospitals are dropping like flies. Bureaucracy won't solve provider shortages or Medicare cuts. D.C. insiders grow their empire, ignoring real fixes like telehealth. Government waste, anyone?",
